					<td class="TB" style="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;padding-top:10pt;vertical-align:top;width: 58.89%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;" valign="top">
						<p class="Texttable" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;"><br/>Up to 293,457,926<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock, which consist of:</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(i) 12,217,468<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issued pursuant to that certain Securities Purchase Agreement, dated August<span class="nobreak"> </span>30, 2024, by and between us and the selling securityholders (the &#8220;Purchase Agreement&#8221;), </p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(ii)&#160;up to 172,397,870<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable upon the exercise of the warrants issued pursuant to the Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;PIPE Warrants&#8221;);</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(iii) 9,358,586<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable upon the conversion of certain promissory notes issued by us on September<span class="nobreak"> </span>29, 2023, October<span class="nobreak"> </span>12, 2023, November<span class="nobreak"> </span>16, 2023, January<span class="nobreak"> </span>30, 2024, January<span class="nobreak"> </span>31, 2024, February<span class="nobreak"> </span>1, 2024 and February<span class="nobreak"> </span>2, 2024 (the &#8220;Convertible Notes,&#8221; and such shares, the &#8220;Convertible Note Shares&#8221;);</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(iv) 68,050,000<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issued to Global Graphene Group, Inc. pursuant to the Merger Agreement, dated February<span class="nobreak"> </span>2, 2024 (the &#8220;Merger Agreement&#8221;), by and among Nubia Brand International Corp. (&#8220;Nubia&#8221;), Honeycomb Battery Company, Nubia Merger Sub, Inc.;</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(v) 3,750,000<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable to Arbor Lake Capital, Inc. pursuant to the Merger Agreement and that certain Strategic Cooperation Consulting Agreement, dated September<span class="nobreak"> </span>11, 2024, by and between the Company and Arbor Lake Capital, Inc.;</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(iv) 500,000<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable to Arbor Lake Capital LLC pursuant to the Consulting Agreement, dated January<span class="nobreak"> </span>31, 2024, by and between the Company and Arbor Lake Capital LLC; </p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(vi) 3,087,500<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock originally issued to Mach FM Acquisitions LLC (the &#8220;Sponsor&#8221;) and its affiliates in connection with the initial public offering of Nubia; </p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(vii) 12,393,002<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issued to Meteora Capital Partners, LP, Meteora Select Trading Opportunities Master, LP, and Meteora Strategic Capital, LLC pursuant to that certain forward purchase agreement, dated December<span class="nobreak"> </span>13, 2023, as amended on August<span class="nobreak"> </span>29, 2024;</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(viii) 123,500<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issued to affiliates of EF Hutton LLC in connection with the initial public offering of Nubia;</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(ix) up to an aggregate of 5,405,000<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable upon the exercise of 5,405,000 private warrants (the &#8220;Private Warrants&#8221;) originally issued in a private placement in connection with Nubia&#8217;s initial public offering; and</p>
						<p class="BL_table" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-12pt;widows:3;margin-top:6pt;"><span class="bullet" style="font-size:10pt;">&#8226;<span style="width: 10px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></span>(x) up to 6,175,000<span class="nobreak"> </span>shares of Common Stock issuable upon the exercise of 6,175,000 warrants (the &#8220;Public Warrants&#8221;) originally issued in the initial public offering of Nubia.</p>
