						<p class="Texttable" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;">We will not receive any cash proceeds from any sale of the shares of our Common Stock by the selling securityholders. We will, however, receive the net proceeds of any Warrants exercised for cash.</p>
