						<p class="Texttable" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;">The selling securityholders will receive all of the net proceeds from the sale of any securities sold by them pursuant to this prospectus. We will not receive any proceeds from these sales. We will, however, receive the net proceeds of any Warrants exercised for cash. See &#8220;<span class="CharOverride-4" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">Use of Proceeds</span>&#8221; in this prospectus.</p>
