		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The derivative liabilities includes the FPA and NRA of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c194" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-24420">35,576,596</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c195" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DerivativeLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-24421">11,152,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively at December<span class="nobreak"> </span>31, 2023. The derivative asset relates to the FPA at December<span class="nobreak"> </span>31, 2023.</p>
		<p class="Text_flush" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c17" continuedAt="_FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock-c17_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock" id="ixv-24422">The Company used a Monte Carlo analysis to determine the fair value of the FPA and NRA.&#160;The fair value measurement of the FPA and the NRA liability at December&#160;31, 2023, was calculated using the following range of weighted average assumptions:</ix:nonNumeric></p>
